error[E1100]: a string chain joins only strings, but this operand is bool
 --> $DIR/chain-comparison.nra:3:68
  |
3 | let same = func(a: string, b: string, c: string) -> string => a .. b == c;
  |                                                                    ^^^^^^ this is bool
  |
  = note: '..' converts nothing to text; call 'to_string()' to join a value
  = help: operators bind more tightly than '..'; parenthesize the chain to apply one to the joined text, as in '(a .. b) == c'
help: convert it to text
  |
3 | let same = func(a: string, b: string, c: string) -> string => a .. (b == c).to_string();
